        "Radiation signature in opposed-flow flame spread",
        "OS24-1 The Effect of Boundary Layer on Blow-Off Extinction in Opposed-Flow Flame Spread: Results of Experiments and Simplified Analysis(invited,Scale modeling on solid combustion,OS24 Scale modeling,FLUID AND THERMODYNAMICS)",
        "Role of Gas Radiation in the Mechanism of Opposed-Flow Flame Spread in a Microgravity Environment",
        "Thickness and Fuel Preheating Effects on Material Flammability in Microgravity from the BASS Experiment",
        "A novel apparatus for flame spread study",
        "Opposed-Flow Flame Spread in a Narrow Channel Apparatus over Thin PMMA Sheets"
